<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Quickstart - Trading Card Collection Tracker</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Instructions for launching the Trading Card Collection Tracker">
    <meta name="author" content="Kevin Bennett">
    <link href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.2.1/css/bootstrap.min.css"
          rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark">
        <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">Trading Card Tracker</a>

        <ul class="navbar-nav">
            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="/documentation">Documentation</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item active">
                <a class="nav-link" href="/quickstart">Quickstart</a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <main class="container mt-4 mb-5">
        <h1>Quickstart Guide</h1>

        <p>
            Make sure Java 21 and Maven are installed.
        </p>

        <ol>
            <li>
                Clone or download the project from the
                <a href="https://github.com/KevinBennett00/trading-card-collection-tracker"
                   target="_blank">
                    GitHub repository
                </a>
            </li>
            <li>Open Terminal.</li>
            <li>Navigate to the repository's "code" folder.</li>
            <li>
                Verify the project by running:
                <pre class="bg-light border p-2"><code>mvn clean verify</code></pre>
            </li>
            <li>
                Launch the JavaFX application by running:
                <pre class="bg-light border p-2"><code>mvn javafx:run</code></pre>
            </li>
            <li>Wait for the Trading Card Collection window to open.</li>
        </ol>

        <h2>Running Application</h2>

        <img src="/images/application-main.png"
             class="img-fluid border"
             alt="Trading Card Collection Tracker running">
    </main>
</body>
</html>